{
  "subject": "Welcome to Oxy",
  "text": "Hi __OXY_WELCOME_NAME__,\n\nWelcome to Oxy. Your new account opens the door to apps for connecting, creating and getting things done. We are glad you are here.\n\nYour email address: __OXY_WELCOME_ADDRESS__\n\nHere is a little guide to help you settle in.\n\nYou are already home in Inbox\n\nYou are reading your first Oxy email right here in Inbox. Here are three things to try when you are ready.\n\n1. Send your first hello\nChoose Compose in Inbox to write a message. Your new Oxy address is ready to share with friends, family and the people you work with.\n\n2. Give everything a place\nUse labels to organise your mail and bundles to keep related conversations together. Archive finished conversations to keep your inbox clear.\n\n3. Make room for what matters\nPin a message to keep it close, or snooze it until you have time to come back. You can try either on this welcome email.\n\nMake your account feel like you\nAdd a profile photo, choose your display name and check your personal information. Your Oxy account is the account you use across Oxy apps, so you can bring a familiar profile with you.\nPersonalise your account: https://accounts.oxy.so/personal-info\n\nOne account. More to discover.\n\nInbox is just the beginning. Explore more from Oxy and choose Continue with Oxy when you sign in. You can use the account you already created.\n\nMention\nShare what you are thinking, discover conversations and connect with people on an open social network.\nDiscover Mention: https://oxy.so/mention\n\nAllo\nMake space for everyday conversations with the people who matter to you.\nDiscover Allo: https://oxy.so/apps/allo\n\nAlia\nMeet your AI assistant for questions, ideas and help with everyday tasks.\nDiscover Alia: https://oxy.so/ai\n\nExplore Oxy apps: https://oxy.so/apps\n\nA good time for a security check\nTake a moment to review how you sign in. You can manage your password and authenticator, check signed-in devices and review connected apps from your account settings.\nReview your security: https://accounts.oxy.so/security\n\nYour account, your choices\nChoose the privacy and sharing settings that work for you. Review your data preferences, decide what activity you share and download a copy of your account data whenever you need it.\nReview privacy and data: https://accounts.oxy.so/data\n\nA little help, whenever you need it\nFrom getting started to managing your account, the Oxy Help Center is here when you have a question. Keep this email handy, or pin it in Inbox so these shortcuts are easy to find.\nVisit the Help Center: https://oxy.so/help\n\nThanks for making Oxy part of your day.\n\nThe Oxy Team\n\nhttps://oxy.so\n\nYou received this welcome email because your Oxy Inbox was created.",
  "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <title>Welcome to Oxy</title>\n  <style>\n    :root { color-scheme:light dark; supported-color-schemes:light dark; }\n    @media only screen and (max-width:540px) {\n      .oxy-padding { padding:28px 20px !important; }\n      .oxy-outer { padding:20px 12px !important; }\n    }\n    @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark) {\n      .oxy-body { background-color:#1f031d !important; color:#fee7ff !important; }\n      .oxy-card { background-color:#4b2947 !important; border-color:#66486d !important; color:#fee7ff !important; }\n      .oxy-heading { color:#fee7ff !important; }\n      .oxy-muted { color:#e0bae6 !important; }\n      .oxy-brand { color:#ec86ff !important; }\n      .oxy-inset { background-color:#1f031d !important; border-color:#66486d !important; }\n      .oxy-button { background-color:#ec86ff !important; border-color:#ec86ff !important; color:#000000 !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"oxy-body\" bgcolor=\"#f7ebf0\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f7ebf0;color:#2a1132;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">Welcome to Oxy. Get comfortable in Inbox, discover your apps and make your account yours.</div>\n  <table data-oxy-welcome-version=\"2\" class=\"oxy-body\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f7ebf0\" style=\"background-color:#f7ebf0;\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-outer\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 16px;\">\n      <!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td><![endif]-->\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:520px;table-layout:fixed;\">\n        <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 0 24px;\"><a href=\"https://oxy.so\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><img src=\"https://oxy.so/logo-mark.svg\" alt=\"Oxy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"display:block;width:64px;height:64px;max-width:100%;border:0;\" /></a></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <p class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#9422ae;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px;\">Welcome to Oxy</p>\n          <h1 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 20px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">Hi __OXY_WELCOME_NAME__,</h1>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Welcome to Oxy. Your new account opens the door to apps for connecting, creating and getting things done. We are glad you are here.</p>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"oxy-inset oxy-heading\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 12px;background-color:#f7ebf0;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;color:#2a1132;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;\">Your email address<br><strong style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all;\">__OXY_WELCOME_ADDRESS__</strong></td></tr></table>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:24px 0 0;\">Here is a little guide to help you settle in.</p>\n  </td></tr><tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <p class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#9422ae;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px;\">Start right here</p><h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">You are already home in Inbox</h2><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">You are reading your first Oxy email right here in Inbox. Here are three things to try when you are ready.</p>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"32\" class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"padding:0 12px 20px 0;color:#9422ae;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;\">1.</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:0 0 20px;\"><h3 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;font-weight:700;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 6px;\">Send your first hello</h3><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0;\">Choose Compose in Inbox to write a message. Your new Oxy address is ready to share with friends, family and the people you work with.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"32\" class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"padding:0 12px 20px 0;color:#9422ae;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;\">2.</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:0 0 20px;\"><h3 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;font-weight:700;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 6px;\">Give everything a place</h3><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0;\">Use labels to organise your mail and bundles to keep related conversations together. Archive finished conversations to keep your inbox clear.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"32\" class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"padding:0 12px 20px 0;color:#9422ae;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;\">3.</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:0 0 20px;\"><h3 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;font-weight:700;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 6px;\">Make room for what matters</h3><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0;\">Pin a message to keep it close, or snooze it until you have time to come back. You can try either on this welcome email.</p></td></tr></table>\n  </td></tr><tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <p class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#9422ae;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px;\">A familiar face</p><h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">Make your account feel like you</h2><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Add a profile photo, choose your display name and check your personal information. Your Oxy account is the account you use across Oxy apps, so you can bring a familiar profile with you.</p><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://accounts.oxy.so/personal-info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Personalise your account</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr><tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <p class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#9422ae;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px;\">More from Oxy</p><h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">One account. More to discover.</h2><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Inbox is just the beginning. Explore more from Oxy and choose Continue with Oxy when you sign in. You can use the account you already created.</p>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"64\" style=\"padding:4px 16px 24px 0;\"><img src=\"https://oxy.so/images/apps/mention.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" style=\"display:block;width:48px;height:48px;max-width:100%;border:0;background-color:#fff7f9;border-radius:16px;\" /></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:0 0 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 6px;\"><a class=\"oxy-brand\" href=\"https://oxy.so/mention\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9422ae;text-decoration:underline;\">Mention</a></h3><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0;\">Share what you are thinking, discover conversations and connect with people on an open social network.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"64\" style=\"padding:4px 16px 24px 0;\"><img src=\"https://oxy.so/images/apps/allo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" style=\"display:block;width:48px;height:48px;max-width:100%;border:0;background-color:#fff7f9;border-radius:16px;\" /></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:0 0 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 6px;\"><a class=\"oxy-brand\" href=\"https://oxy.so/apps/allo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9422ae;text-decoration:underline;\">Allo</a></h3><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0;\">Make space for everyday conversations with the people who matter to you.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"64\" style=\"padding:4px 16px 24px 0;\"><img src=\"https://oxy.so/images/apps/alia.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" style=\"display:block;width:48px;height:48px;max-width:100%;border:0;background-color:#fff7f9;border-radius:16px;\" /></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:0 0 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 6px;\"><a class=\"oxy-brand\" href=\"https://oxy.so/ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9422ae;text-decoration:underline;\">Alia</a></h3><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0;\">Meet your AI assistant for questions, ideas and help with everyday tasks.</p></td></tr></table>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://oxy.so/apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Explore Oxy apps</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr><tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <p class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#9422ae;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px;\">Peace of mind</p><h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">A good time for a security check</h2><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Take a moment to review how you sign in. You can manage your password and authenticator, check signed-in devices and review connected apps from your account settings.</p><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://accounts.oxy.so/security\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Review your security</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr><tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <p class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#9422ae;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px;\">You decide</p><h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">Your account, your choices</h2><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Choose the privacy and sharing settings that work for you. Review your data preferences, decide what activity you share and download a copy of your account data whenever you need it.</p><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://accounts.oxy.so/data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Review privacy and data</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr><tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <p class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#9422ae;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px;\">We are here to help</p><h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">A little help, whenever you need it</h2><p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">From getting started to managing your account, the Oxy Help Center is here when you have a question. Keep this email handy, or pin it in Inbox so these shortcuts are easy to find.</p><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://oxy.so/help\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Visit the Help Center</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr><tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 20px 20px;\">\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Thanks for making Oxy part of your day.<br>The Oxy Team</p>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 20px;\"><img src=\"https://oxy.so/logo-mark.svg\" alt=\"Oxy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" style=\"display:block;width:40px;height:40px;max-width:100%;border:0;\" /></td></tr></table>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0;\">You received this welcome email because your Oxy Inbox was created.</p>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n      <!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
}
